    "detailed_description": "Pot ventured deep underground to find the most exotic flower he could, but now he's lost and needs to find the way out.  Help Pot find his way through this precision platformer by conquering jumps and puzzles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568880/extras/4bc4f9e7a206869752d7f9d2003b99bc.avif?t=1717457474\" width=600 height=124 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Hours of difficult precision platforming &amp; puzzles<br></li><li> 3 different biomes<br></li><li> Beautiful art with immersive sounds and soundtrack<br></li><li> Mushrooms</li></ul><br>The game features unique abilities that are used in unique ways and can be mastered over time: jumping, coyote time, and wall climbing.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568880/extras/bf0e16b0eb2b01b0c2282b7e5f3c2893.poster.avif?t=1717457474\" width=650 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568880/extras/bf0e16b0eb2b01b0c2282b7e5f3c2893.webm?t=1717457474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568880/extras/bf0e16b0eb2b01b0c2282b7e5f3c2893.mp4?t=1717457474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Find phoenix feathers to guard your progress and set your respawn point.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568880/extras/37fbdf0654d505b2a076144ffdc61437.poster.avif?t=1717457474\" width=650 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2568880/extras/37fbdf0654d505b2a076144ffdc61437.webm?t=1717457474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.ak